-- Works & Sources: link to the work, not the author (owner, 2026-10-12).
--
-- Many works under Works & Sources linked to their author's page (a CCEL or
-- Wikisource author page, or a whole volume) instead of the work they name, and
-- a few sources had gone dead. scripts/check-work-links.mjs fetched every link,
-- read the page's own title, and proposed a better address only when the page it
-- found names the work: its text on New Advent, CCEL or Wikisource first, else a
-- Wikipedia article about it. This applies the ones it was sure of.
--
-- Each update is guarded by the address it replaces, so it never overwrites a link
-- edited in the admin tools since the audit ran, and it is safe to run twice.
-- The works it could not settle are listed for the owner and left as they were.

